  "question": {
    "text": "Tangents are drawn to the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math> at the points where it intersects the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the point of intersection of these tangents is"
